Cell["Child::place: Child[XMLPattern[\"ul\"], XMLPattern[\"li\"]] is not a pattern. Child is a constraint, which can only be an argument of the bracket after XMLPattern[tag, attrs] or of XMLDocument: XMLPattern[\"ul\"][Child[x : XMLPattern[\"li\"]]] :> x gives the li children of each ul. Child takes one pattern: for children that match several patterns, give several constraints, Child[a], Child[b], or a list, {___, a, ___, b, ___}.", "Message", "MSG"],

